  "prompt": "What is the deadline for filing the annual income tax return of an individual?",
  "attempt": 1,
  "runtimeCommit": "22b845afe1fe16bfa4821804d528f469366e4f8c",
  "answer": "### Short Answer\nThe deadline for filing the annual income tax return of an individual is on or before April 15 of the following year after the taxable year.\n\n### Interpretation\n\n### Practical Meaning\nTaxpayers should ensure that their income tax returns are prepared and submitted by April 15 to avoid penalties and interest for late filing. It is advisable to keep accurate records throughout the year to facilitate timely and accurate filing.",
